e, and $state expressions read from it.\\nCRITICAL: You MUST include state patches whenever your UI displays data via $state, $bindState, $bindItem, $item, or $index expressions, or uses repeat to iterate over arrays. Without state, these references resolve to nothing and repeat lists render zero items.\\nOutput state patches right after the ",
